# Raw AI-generated rasters (1.4–2 MB each, 42 MB in total) stay out of git: the palette-snapped
# SVGs in mascot/vector/ are the production assets, and these sources live on the design machine
# and in the ChatGPT conversation they came from (see mascot/PROMPTS.md, mascot/poses/POSES.md).
mascot/directions/*.png
mascot/model-sheet/*.png
mascot/poses/*.png

# Regenerable from the rasters with mascot/vector/trace*.jsx + palette_snap.py
*.ai
*-preview.png
mascot/vector/*.svg
!mascot/vector/*-brand.svg
mascot/vector/poses/*.svg
!mascot/vector/poses/*-brand.svg
mascot/vector/*.html
__pycache__/
